[{"title":"宫词 其一","author":"董少玉","text":"昼琐深宫鹤梦迟，御阶花木接瑶池。\n月明独照长生殿，无复尊前捧玉卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":884,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其二","author":"董少玉","text":"西飞紫燕落花多，岁岁惟愁老去何。\n别却昭阳人更远，经年翠辇不曾过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":885,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海棠花","author":"董少玉","text":"小楼风定月初斜，紫玉新枝绾落霞。\n睡起不堪重秉烛，春来愁杀海棠花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":886,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄林野送丘生北上 其一","author":"呼文如","text":"雪中送君君莫辞，长风吹妾妾自知。\n一从刻臂盟公子，肯惜寒云上鬓丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":887,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄林野送丘生北上 其二","author":"呼文如","text":"送君北上黄林隅，路旁争问谁家姝？\n胡姬自言今罗敷，千骑中央夫婿殊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":888,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送生后还李楼","author":"呼文如","text":"莫问天台落日愁，桃花片片水悠悠。\n寒窗一闭秦箫月，惹得人呼燕子楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":889,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"皂罗袍 其一 四时词","author":"呼文如","text":"早是垒灯儿时节。\n见燕儿做垒，对对欹斜。\n榆钱儿买不得春风夜，杨花儿故意飞残雪。\n门儿重掩，灯儿半灭。\n人儿不见，病儿怎说？\n腰儿掩过裙儿摺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":890,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"皂罗袍 其二 四时词","author":"呼文如","text":"早是莺儿时候，见莲花儿出水，瓣瓣风流。\n心儿欲火畏红榴，鼻儿酸涕过梅豆。\n门儿重掩，帘儿半钩。\n人儿不见，病儿怎瘳？\n扇儿折叠眉儿皱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":891,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"皂罗袍 其三 四时词","author":"呼文如","text":"早是雁儿天气，见露珠儿夺暑，点点侵衣。\n针儿七夕把肠刺，砧儿万户敲肝碎。\n门儿重掩，帐儿半垂。\n人儿不见，病儿怎支？\n书儿难写心儿事。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":892,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"皂罗袍 其四 四时词","author":"呼文如","text":"早见雪儿飘粉，见梅儿潇洒，蕊蕊争春。\n梦儿冻死也离魂，气儿呵杀全无影。\n门儿重掩，被儿半薰。\n人儿不见，病儿怎禁？\n屏儿靠热床儿冷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":893,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刺血寄生诗","author":"呼文如","text":"长门当日叹浮沈，一赋翻令帝宠深。\n岂是黄金能买客，相如曾见白头吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":894,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得生诗寄怨","author":"呼文如","text":"人间自是语便便，不是春风不肯怜。\n为寄一声何满子，相思今日尽君前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":895,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与生饮醉后泣下口占","author":"呼文如","text":"悲歌当哭有馀悲，今夕同君醉始知。\n却倚胡床禁不得，一时双泪堕金卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":896,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"文如留馆中赋别","author":"丘谦之","text":"回思往事怨蹉跎，复有新愁奈若何。\n清梦不缘神女苦，小词难得雪儿歌。\n隔窗雨逐流苏堕，落叶飞随翠簟多。\n若问此时留别意，双星七夕在银河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":897,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追丘生于临皋道中","author":"呼文如","text":"武昌东下水茫茫，一日扁舟远自将。\n莫怪人疑桃叶渡，从来难得有心郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":898,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别后舟中风雨却寄","author":"呼文如","text":"不堪风雨夕，憔悴在孤舟。\n泪与波声湿，灯萦暝色秋。\n梦犹疑赤壁，目已断黄州。\n此际君知否，湘妃自可求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":899,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至武昌寄生","author":"呼文如","text":"孤舟别后两相望，霜露凄凄落叶黄。\n黄鹄矶头天万里，知君何日渡潇湘？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":900,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生如京师不能从奉寄","author":"呼文如","text":"寄来尺素有谁知，双泪龙钟重妾思。\n千载高山流水调，祇应生死尽交期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":901,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别后","author":"呼文如","text":"别后江头夜雨凉，可怜憔悴谢红妆。\n腹中不有郎行路，那得车轮日转肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":902,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以诗订丘生前约 其一","author":"呼文如","text":"流水郎车马，垂杨妾鬓丝。\n春江他自好，一一入相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":903,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以诗订丘生前约 其二","author":"呼文如","text":"时时可问花，处处堪沽酒。\n风波君不知，愁杀楼中妇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":904,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛转词归丘生后作","author":"呼文如","text":"赤壁矶，蟠桃宴，妾年二八郎相见。\n鸳鸯锁，燕子楼，空床绣被为郎留。\n郎潮海，妾鄂渚，银河相望牛与女。\n妾倚闾，郎悬车，文君自奔马相如。\n郎吟诗，妾劝酒，彩毫叵罗日在手。\n郎操瑟，妾鼓琴，天长地久同一心。\n珠为灯，玉作窟，妾是小星郎是月。\n锦障泥，绣屠苏，郎乘驷马妾坐舆。\n斧伐柯，则不远，若有曲直在郎眼。\n心百折，肠九回，即令万死妾焉辞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":905,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚晴","author":"周洁","text":"久雨愁无极，斜阳喜乍开。\n树披残霭出，山挟断云来。\n的历穿花径，逶迤过渚台。\n更须林月上，清赏一追陪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":906,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江边思家","author":"周洁","text":"北望一含愁，归心俯碧流。\n滩虽注南海，湘亦接巴流。\n天阙当牛斗，台城枕石头。\n侬家生长地，终岁信悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":907,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立秋","author":"周洁","text":"白帝严金驾，乘风下紫微。\n德惟宣湛露，令即屏炎辉。\n乍惊青梧落，将催赤雁飞。\n何须赋团扇，恩顾似君稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":908,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秦淮","author":"周洁","text":"秣陵无处望，漓水正前流。\n何不教东下，将心到石头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":909,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦还京","author":"周洁","text":"自去长干侧，终年桂岭西。\n新秋望乡处，无奈白云迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":910,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆父","author":"周洁","text":"忆昔当残腊，还家雪正飞。\n三年无一字，不忍见鸿归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":911,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伤长姊","author":"周洁","text":"花落空萦恨，莺啼更助哀。\n芳魂似流水，一去不重回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":912,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登楼","author":"周洁","text":"凭阑一望白云重，松竹萧森裛露浓。\n树外连漓流不断，依稀如听秣陵钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":913,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏诸姊作假花","author":"周洁","text":"镂花雕叶百般新，巧手分明遂夺真。\n自是深闺无定鉴，金钱输与弄虚人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":914,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋闺梦戍诗 其一","author":"马氏女（虎关","text":"夫重封侯妾爱轻，漫欹琥珀恋寒更。\n游魂自苦人何在，芳草无言路不明。\n仿佛玉关伤旧别，徘徊油幕订新盟。\n梦回檐马迎风处，犹是沙场剑戟声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":915,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋闺梦戍诗 其二","author":"马氏女（虎关","text":"屈尽纤纤销尽眉，广宁消息竟迟迟。\n十年笑语灯前事，千里关山枕上期。\n萱草既零堂北雨，梅花将发岭南枝。\n青春尽伴寒更老，再莫相逢日落时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":916,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋闺梦戍诗 其三","author":"马氏女（虎关","text":"秋雨丝丝秋夜凉，新愁还比旧愁长。\n落花落叶和灯落，荒陇荒云并岁荒。\n白昼想君歌《白苎》，黄昏愁妾梦黄梁。\n何时息马嘶归马，洗尽诗肠换酒肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":917,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋闺梦戍诗 其四","author":"马氏女（虎关","text":"仰窥北斗认辽阳，一夕西风引梦长。\n罗袜路生难问信，石城烟绕怯停装。\n草青自判身为冢，塞黑俄惊骨似芒。\n正好相关商别恨，晓鸦啼散一天霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":918,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋闺梦戍诗 其五","author":"马氏女（虎关","text":"商气萧森下紫虚，乱飘松叶覆茅庐。\n病怀不耐秋多感，习梦还来路已迂。\n记里怕闻厢上鼓，指南遥忆海边车。\n断魂查霭谁惊觉，叶落空山响木鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":919,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋闺梦戍诗 其六","author":"马氏女（虎关","text":"自昔良人爱远游，百怀堆积在眉头。\n一钩斜月临蒲榻，满枕离魂绕戍楼。\n陇右谷刚过子午，川南峡已度春秋。\n梦回每为多情惜，李广从来不拜侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":920,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"静坐","author":"邢慈静","text":"荆钗裙布念重违，却扫焚香自掩扉。\n莫向吹箫羡嬴女，多年已办五铢衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":921,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读三国志","author":"邢慈静","text":"抱膝长吟道自尊，一时鱼水感深恩。\n当年若稳陇中卧，不到秋风五丈原。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":922,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南荒歌","author":"屠瑶瑟","text":"南荒古炎徼，十月无霜飞。\n停梭悲远道，不用寄寒衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":923,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浣纱女","author":"屠瑶瑟","text":"日暖银塘绿，溪边出浣纱。\n若耶烟似雨，步步入荷花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":924,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"爱妾换马","author":"屠瑶瑟","text":"卿爱落雁姿，侬爱飞龙骑。\n日暮别挥鞭，男儿何意气。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":925,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清溪小姑曲","author":"屠瑶瑟","text":"小姑何代女，明妆清溪曲。\n风吹香粉销，水映眉痕绿。\n野庙寂无人，日暮飞属玉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":926,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜歌","author":"屠瑶瑟","text":"子夜夜转长，帘前月华吐。\n只解歌调工，谁识歌心苦。\n清商激凉风，良人在淮楚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":927,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日白苎词","author":"屠瑶瑟","text":"条风吹花花拂筝，上林宫柳闻啼莺。\n日暖高台栖落英，翩跹粉蝶双翅轻。\n梨花细雨不胜情，夜月宝瑟杳无声。\n游人连袂出东城，杏衫榴裙挟玉笙。\n贱妾不言泪暗倾，别恨萦牵羞独行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":928,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"礼观音大士 其一","author":"屠瑶瑟","text":"水月观音水月明，只将慈眼视众生。\n众生无量悲无量，应感如传空谷声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":929,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"礼观音大士 其二","author":"屠瑶瑟","text":"千江一片月轮孤，直是禅心映玉壶。\n处处普门凭示现，凭君便作女人呼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":930,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王蕙芳于归花烛词","author":"屠瑶瑟","text":"妆镜朱颜借玉荷，初匀眉黛拂双蛾。\n云英旧有蓝桥约，一夜香风到大罗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":931,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜赠七襄","author":"屠瑶瑟","text":"绮阁知音总不群，挑灯刺绣薛灵芸。\n夜凉明月低绳户，犹简兰闺倒薤文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":932,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送外","author":"屠瑶瑟","text":"萧萧梧叶作秋声，况复征人欲远行。\n此去西泠烟草碧，月高霜落水痕清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":933,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲 其一","author":"屠瑶瑟","text":"六桥垂柳两边分，日暮吴歌隔岸闻。\n祇解莲花如粉面，不知荷叶是罗裙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":934,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲 其二","author":"屠瑶瑟","text":"妾飞两桨入清溪，杏子春衫一色齐。\n欲采芙蓉诒女伴，何人寄到苎萝西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":935,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙曲 其一","author":"屠瑶瑟","text":"礼罢高真控鹤归，八琅仙乐月痕微。\n青天忽堕琉璃色，照见仙人薜荔衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":936,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙曲 其三","author":"屠瑶瑟","text":"天风飒飒步声虚，一片红云控帝居。\n闻道茅家开夕宴，上元亲授太霄书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":937,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜歌","author":"沈天孙","text":"轻桡荡北渚，中流拗藕丝。\n藕丝不可断，缠绵会有时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":938,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日送七宝娣归宁","author":"沈天孙","text":"一曲骊歌泪暗垂，香车陌上过春荑。\n关情最是蘼芜草，何必杨枝绾别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":939,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自君之出矣","author":"沈天孙","text":"自君之出矣，孤月鉴虚牖。\n思君如飞花，随风不回首。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":940,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏走笔和湘灵","author":"沈天孙","text":"旖旎薰风柳乍醒，榴花刺眼媚遥汀。\n傍人桐树枝枝绿，出水荷钱叶叶青。\n陇外乔桑飞雊雉，阶前茂草隐新萤。\n春从杜宇声中去，空翠浓阴又满庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":941,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赪桐","author":"沈天孙","text":"朱萼疑看九月枫，繁枝又借峄阳桐。\n丹须吐舌迎风艳，绛蜡笼纱照月空。\n西域应分安石紫，寝宫可作麦英红。\n绿珠宴罢归金谷，七尺珊瑚映水中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":942,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠湘灵 其一","author":"沈天孙","text":"芙蓉两颊映罗衣，笑拂钗头双凤飞。\n仿佛疑施青步障，知君能解小郎围。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":943,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠湘灵 其二","author":"沈天孙","text":"柳眼低垂护墨池，菱花掩映远山眉。\n输卿刀尺工挑锦，夜夜灯前借履綦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":944,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"礼观音大士二首和湘灵 其一","author":"沈天孙","text":"莲花宝座百由旬，莲表禅心不染尘。\n大士傥容为侍者，此生愿脱女人身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":945,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"礼观音大士二首和湘灵 其二","author":"沈天孙","text":"天冠璎珞现重重，风送潮声入梵钟。\n但愿人心如水月，何愁不得睹金容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":946,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花烛词赠王蕙芳","author":"沈天孙","text":"比翼双飞宿上林，流苏掩映合欢衾。\n香奁赋就怜苏蕙，织出回文寄锦心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":947,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜","author":"沈天孙","text":"虫飞纨扇早知秋，明月穿窗照画楼。\n洒泪两行何处落，临风寄向故园流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":948,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙曲","author":"沈天孙","text":"清溪白石出胡麻，香暖瑶池九影花。\n见说玄都无甲子，春光常住阿环家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":949,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明妃","author":"沈天孙","text":"塞北黄沙入马蹄，玉关千里雪沾衣。\n君恩不逐金刀断，漠漠香魂月下归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":950,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采桑曲","author":"沈天孙","text":"青溪女儿爱罗裙，提筐陌上踏春云。\n蚕饥日暮思归去，不敢回头看使君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":951,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送西升秋试时七夕前二日","author":"沈天孙","text":"一咏河梁黯自惊，兰舟叠鼓送君行。\n朱弦暗度销魂曲，银管吹残唱别声。\n露下西泠秋影白，烟深灵鹫月华清。\n翻怜后夜双星渡，何事人间唱渭城？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":952,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日多病有怀夫婿","author":"李大纯","text":"几欲为文袪病魔，其如愁极病增多。\n暖风却怪掀帘箔，凉月何心到芰荷。\n只以一灯甘寂寞，故令双鬓乱婆娑。\n梦魂若报行人至，惊醒东邻《子夜歌》。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":953,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郎君游闽拟以是日登陆风雨大作心甚忧之","author":"李大纯","text":"怜君今日渡仙霞，雨骤风狂遍落花。\n此地应无故人在，行囊知到阿谁家？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":954,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词","author":"李大纯","text":"蛾眉二八绝堪怜，闭却深宫不见天。\n春去春来都莫问，只凭寒暑定流年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":955,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春即事","author":"全少光","text":"经时浑暖候，映日有青枝。\n花落蜂犹恋，春归草不知。\n竹苞仍个个，柳线亦丝丝。\n独忆深闺里，柔风入暮时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":956,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨夜","author":"全少光","text":"终宵疏雨滴心头，点点离情点点秋。\n怪道旧衣思旧日，且将新线结新愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":957,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]